{"4192760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "G-MODEアーカイブス+ ARMORED CORE MOBILE 3", "steam_appid": 4192760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fight on—just to survive.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A world of rival powers, with tomorrow unknown.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>ARMORED CORE MOBILE 3 :</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D mech action game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through stages by completing each mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of battle scenarios and mission types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your machine’s parts to change your battle style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exclusive story only available in this title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A port of a Japanese flip phone title (feature phones popular before smartphones).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This release does not add elements such as languages and achievements that were not part of the original version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Series Overview</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A port of the classic title originally released in 2007 for feature phones, part of <i>FromSoftware</i> acclaimed 3D mech action series, <i>ARMORED CORE</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story’s timeline fills in the gap between the console versions <strong><i>“ARMORED CORE NEXUS”</i></strong> and <strong><i>“ARMORED CORE LAST RAVEN”</i></strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Game System</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by completing each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose parts for each section of your machine to build your own customized unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then take on the operation objectives set for each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for high-rated mission completions to achieve the top “Raven rank - S”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out operations across various scenarios, including assaults and defenses, in urban areas and open wastelands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to battle through fast-paced mech action combat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fight on—just to survive.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A world of rival powers, with tomorrow unknown.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>ARMORED CORE MOBILE 3 :</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D mech action game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through stages by completing each mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of battle scenarios and mission types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your machine’s parts to change your battle style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exclusive story only available in this title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A port of a Japanese flip phone title (feature phones popular before smartphones).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This release does not add elements such as languages and achievements that were not part of the original version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Series Overview</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A port of the classic title originally released in 2007 for feature phones, part of <i>FromSoftware</i> acclaimed 3D mech action series, <i>ARMORED CORE</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story’s timeline fills in the gap between the console versions <strong><i>“ARMORED CORE NEXUS”</i></strong> and <strong><i>“ARMORED CORE LAST RAVEN”</i></strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Game System</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by completing each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose parts for each section of your machine to build your own customized unit.</p><p class=\